<title>PORTUGAL: CECA launches 8.45 bln esc, five-year Navigator.</title>
<headline>CECA launches 8.45 bln esc, five-year Navigator.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by lead managers Banco Portugues de Investimento, Caixa Geral de Depositos and Banco Espirito Santo.</p>
<p>BORROWER European Iron and Steel Community</p>
<p>    AMT 8.45 billion escudos	   COUPON Zero</p>
<p>MATURITY Five years ISS PRICE 75.72 percent</p>
<p>REPAYMENT PRICE Par IMPLICIT YIELD 5.72 pct</p>
<p>    PAY DATE June 26    EXPIRY DATE June 26, 2002</p>
<p>    LAST S&amp;P AAA	  LISTING Lux</p>
<p>DENOMS 100,000 escudos</p>
<p>    NEG PLG  Yes	  CRS DEFLT  Yes  FORCE MAJ Yes</p>
<p>CLEARING Euroclear/Cedel</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
